<title>USA: RCM to acquire Programming Alternatives.</title>
<headline>RCM to acquire Programming Alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>RCM Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it agreed to acquire Programming Alternatives of Minnesota Inc.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in 30 days. It is subject to satisfactory completion of due diligence, execution of a definitive acquisition agreement and other conditions.</p>
<p>Programming Alternatives is a specialty provider of information technology consultants. RCM provides contract and temporary staffing services.</p>
</text>
